  "contentHtml": "\n<div><!--IMG2--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/80362471.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG2--><br>Ashanti Eliott Smith тэр наснаасаа хөгшин харагддаг 7 настай охин бөгөөд тэрээр сургуульд явдаг юм байна. Гэвч сургуулийнх нь хүүхдүүд тэрнийг шоолж доромжилдог байна. Тэрээр ховор эдгэршгүй өвчтэй бөгөөд энэ зүйл маш ховор тохиолддог байна. Их британид энэхүү охин амьдардаг гэвч энэхүү Hutchinson Gilford progeria syndrome хэмээх ховор өвчинтэй хүн дэлхийд зөвхөн 52&nbsp; л байдаг байна... Тэр яг л хөгшин эмгэн шиг харагддаг. Тэр халзан бөгөөд&nbsp; зүрхний өвчинтэй. Тэр дөнгөж 13кг жинтэй 90 см өндөртэй байна. <br>Хүмүүс түүнрүү ширтэж хардаг. Бүх хүн түүнийг даган харж гайхахад тэр урдаас нь инээмсэглэн. Би ийм хөөрхөн хэмээн хэлдэг байна. <br><!--IMG2--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/80362471.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG2--><br><!--IMG3--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/19745655.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/51649388.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG4--><br><!--IMG5--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/04968794.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG5--><br><!--IMG6--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/53386104.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG6--><br><!--IMG7--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/61007141.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG7--><br><!--IMG8--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/13921465.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG8--><br><!--IMG9--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/87077411.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG9--><br><!--IMG10--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/57848225.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG10--><br><!--IMG11--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/00348337.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG11--><br><!--IMG12--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/23230006.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG12--><br><!--IMG13--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/25109017.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/s25109017.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG13--><br><!--IMG14--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/80282199.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/s80282199.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG14--><br><!--IMG15--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/95676888.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/s95676888.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG15--><br><!--IMG16--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/01055766.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG16--><br><!--IMG17--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/51301851.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG17--><br><!--IMG18--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/82582413.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG18--><br><!--IMG19--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/50776720.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG19--><br><!--IMG20--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/09775893.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062343im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/s09775893.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG20--><br></div><div></div>",
